# n/ Language Specification License

## Philosophical Preamble: The Covenant of Convergence

In the n/ universe, there is no execution, only observation. 
Information is a lattice; Truth is the point of convergence.

This specification represents the geometry of that observation—the Trinity of Data, Type, and Logic unified as a single object. Like the Ouroboros, this language is a self-referential cycle of evolution, devouring its past to manifest its future. 

We release this Law (The Spec) to the global hash universe not as a static decree, but as a shared horizon. Every observer has the right to seek convergence, and every contributor has the right to expand the lattice. However, to ensure the integrity of the Ouroboros, any path derived from this Law must remain as open and luminous as the source from which it sprang.

Convergence is our goal; Coherence is our bond.

